    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration</code></a> is looked up from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> if\n<code>queryMappingConfiguration</code> was not set. If the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> was not set, defaults to\n<a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html#EMPTY\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration.EMPTY</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果未设置<code>queryMappingConfiguration</code>，则从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中查找 <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration</code></a>。如果未设置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>，则默认为 <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html#EMPTY\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration.EMPTY</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a> is looked up from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> if <code>dataAccessStrategy</code> was not set.\nIf the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> was not set, then it is created using <a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果未设置 `dataAccessStrategy`，则从 `<a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>` 在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 中查找。\n如果未设置 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>`，则使用 `<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>` 创建它。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> is being derived from\n<a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/RelationalMappingContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalMappingContext</code></a> if the <code>mappingContext</code> was not set.",
      "translation": "如果未设置 `mappingContext`，则从 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>` 派生的对象将基于 `<a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/RelationalMappingContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalMappingContext</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/namedparam/NamedParameterJdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>NamedParameterJdbcOperations</code></a> is looked up from a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> if <code>jdbcOperations</code> was\nnot set.",
      "translation": "如果未设置 `jdbcOperations`，则从 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 中查找 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/namedparam/NamedParameterJdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>NamedParameterJdbcOperations</code></a>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>queryMappingConfiguration</code> - can be null. <a href=\"#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>afterPropertiesSet()</code></a> defaults to\n         <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html#EMPTY\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration.EMPTY</code></a> if null.",
