      "source": "Special adapter for Springs <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/FactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>FactoryBean</code></a> interface to allow easy setup of\nrepository factories via Spring configuration. Ideally, the factory bean is configured by providing a\n<a href=\"../../core/JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a>, <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>, and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEventPublisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEventPublisher</code></a> instance to avoid partial\nconfiguration.",
      "translation": "为 Springs 提供的专用适配器，用于通过 Spring 配置轻松设置仓库工厂。理想情况下，应通过提供 <a href=\"../../core/JdbcAggregateOperations.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core\"><code>JdbcAggregateOperations</code></a>、<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationEventPublisher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationEventPublisher</code></a> 实例来配置工厂 Bean，以避免部分配置。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<ul>\n<li>如果未设置 `mappingContext`，则从 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>` 派生的对象将基于 `<a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/RelationalMappingContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalMappingContext</code></a>`。</li>\n<li>如果未设置 `jdbcOperations`，则从 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 中查找 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/namedparam/NamedParameterJdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>NamedParameterJdbcOperations</code></a>`。</li>\n<li>如果未设置<code>queryMappingConfiguration</code>，则从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中查找 <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration</code></a>。如果未设置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>，则默认为 <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html#EMPTY\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration.EMPTY</code></a>。</li>\n<li>如果未设置 `dataAccessStrategy`，则从 `<a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>` 在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 中查找。\n如果未设置 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>`，则使用 `<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>` 创建它。</li>\n</ul>",
      "translation": "<ul>\n<li>如果未设置 `mappingContext`，则从 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a>` 派生的对象将基于 `<a href=\"../../../relational/core/mapping/RelationalMappingContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.relational.core.mapping\"><code>RelationalMappingContext</code></a>。</li>\n<li>如果未设置 `jdbcOperations`，则从 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 中查找 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/jdbc/core/namedparam/NamedParameterJdbcOperations.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>NamedParameterJdbcOperations</code></a>。</li>\n<li>如果未设置<code>queryMappingConfiguration</code>，则从 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 中查找 <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration</code></a>。如果未设置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>，则默认为 <a href=\"../../core/convert/QueryMappingConfiguration.html#EMPTY\"><code>QueryMappingConfiguration.EMPTY</code></a>。</li>\n<li>如果未设置 `dataAccessStrategy`，则从 `<a href=\"../../core/convert/DataAccessStrategy.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.jdbc.core.convert\"><code>DataAccessStrategy</code></a>` 在 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>` 中查找。\n如果未设置 `<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>`，则使用 `<a href=\"../../../relational/core/dialect/Dialect.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.relational.core.dialect\"><code>Dialect</code></a>` 创建它。</li>\n</ul>",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
